          {
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "用户Token。\n用于获取操作API的权限。[获取Token接口](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-ocr/ocr_03_0005.html)响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值即为Token。",
